        <div class="article">
                <div class="articleTitle02">   
                      <h2>上海商学院2027年硕士研究生招生简章</h2>
                      <div class="articleAuthor">
                        
                            <span>发布时间：2026-09-30</span>       
                       
                     </div>
                    
                 </div>


                 <div class="article02">
                    <p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 150%; font-size: 21px;"> &nbsp; &nbsp;上海商学院是一所商科特色鲜明的普通公办高等学校，</span><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:仿宋">学校坚持</span>“<span style="font-family:仿宋">以商立校、应用为本</span>”<span style="font-family:仿宋">办学理念，秉承</span>“<span style="font-family:仿宋">厚德博学、经世济民</span>”<span style="font-family:仿宋">校训精神，全力打造</span>“<span style="font-family:仿宋">应用型、创新性、国际化</span>”<span style="font-family:仿宋">办学特色，全面建设特色鲜明的高水平应用型商科大学。</span></span><br></p> 
<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="text-indent: 43px; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; line-height: 150%; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><br></span></span></p> 
<p style=";line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">一、培养目标</span></span></strong></p> 
<p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">培养热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，拥护社会主义制度，遵纪守法，品德良好，具有服务国家</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">、</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">服务人民的社会责任感，掌握本学科坚实的基础理论和系统的专业知识，具有创新精神、创新能力和较强解决实际问题的能力、能够承担专业技术或管理工作、具有良好职业素养的高层次</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">实践创新</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">型专门人才。</span></span></p> 
<p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋"><br></span></span></p> 
<p style=";line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">二、招生计划</span></span></strong></p> 
<p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">我校</span>2027<span style="font-family:仿宋">年拟招收全日制专业学位硕士研究生</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">26</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">名，具体拟招生计划人数参见下表。录取时将根据教育部最终下达招生计划，综合考虑生源状况和发展需要，对学校招生总数及各专业招生数进行适当调整。</span></span></p> 
<table cellspacing="0" width="577" align="center"> 
 <tbody> 
  <tr class="firstRow"> 
   <td width="132" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext; border-style: solid;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">学院</span></strong></p></td> 
   <td width="133" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext; border-style: solid;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">专业名称</span></span></strong></p></td> 
   <td width="94" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext; border-style: solid;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">专业代码</span></strong></p></td> 
   <td width="95" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext; border-style: solid;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">培养方式</span></span></strong></p></td> 
   <td width="123" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext; border-style: solid;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">拟招生人数（人）</span></span></strong></p></td> 
  </tr> 
  <tr style="height:38px"> 
   <td width="132" valign="center" rowspan="2" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">商务经济学院</span></p></td> 
   <td width="133" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">金融</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">硕士</span></p></td> 
   <td width="94" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px">0251</span></p></td> 
   <td width="95" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">全日制</span></span></p></td> 
   <td width="123" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px">50</span></p></td> 
  </tr> 
  <tr style="height:38px"> 
   <td width="133" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">国际商务硕士</span></p></td> 
   <td width="94" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">0</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px">254</span></p></td> 
   <td width="95" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">全日制</span></span></p></td> 
   <td width="123" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">0</span></span></p></td> 
  </tr> 
  <tr style="height:38px"> 
   <td width="132" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">酒店管理学院</span></span></p></td> 
   <td width="133" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-color: windowtext; border-style: solid; border-top-color: initial; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">旅游管理</span></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 19px">硕士</span></p></td> 
